        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Held by Genesect\n:   Holder’s buster is white, and its Techno Blast becomes Ice-type.",
      "short_effect": "Grants Genesect a white, Ice-type Techno Blast.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Tenu par Genesect, ce module\nchange la capacité TechnoBuster\nen une capacité de type Glace.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A cassette to be held by Genesect.\nIt changes Techno Blast to an\nIce-type move.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A cassette to be held by Genesect.\nIt changes Techno Blast to an\nIce-type move.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ゲノセクトに　もたせると\nテクノバスターという　わざが\nこおりタイプになる　カセット。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "게노세크트에게 지니게 하면\n테크노버스터라는 기술이\n얼음타입으로 바뀌는 카세트.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenu par Genesect, ce module change la\ncapacité TechnoBuster en une capacité de type\nGlace.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gibt man es Genesect zum Tragen, wandelt es\nden Typ der Attacke Techblaster in Eis um.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una bonita esfera que potencia los movimientos\nde tipo Dragón y Agua. Debe llevarla Palkia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
